  {
   "id": "el725763863",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 112,
   "width": 616,
   "height": 131.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 249103478,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 922121677,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PART 1 - capacity on paper (Qwen3-8B BF16)\nkv_bytes/token = 2 (K,V) x 36 layers x 8 kv heads x 128 x 2 B\n              = 147,456 B = 144 KiB/token\nper worker: 38,000 MiB slice -> weights 15.3 GiB, KV 15.8 GiB\n            = 115,299 tokens (SGLang startup log)\nmax_len 8,192  -> 14 seqs/worker  |  app turn ~2,000 -> ~57\nengine cap max_running = 8  -> scheduler binds before KV",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el981836553",
   "originalText": "PART 1 - capacity on paper (Qwen3-8B BF16)\nkv_bytes/token = 2 (K,V) x 36 layers x 8 kv heads x 128 x 2 B\n              = 147,456 B = 144 KiB/token\nper worker: 38,000 MiB slice -> weights 15.3 GiB, KV 15.8 GiB\n            = 115,299 tokens (SGLang startup log)\nmax_len 8,192  -> 14 seqs/worker  |  app turn ~2,000 -> ~57\nengine cap max_running = 8  -> scheduler binds before KV",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el140260662",
   "type": "rectangle",
