   "text": "BACKGROUND  (gateway/monitoring/)\npoll every 5 s: /health, /v1/models, /metrics\nreadiness: warmup = 5 requests on the shared\n   prefix, then ready (weights loaded != ready)\nramp for a returning worker: 1 -> 2 -> 4 -> 8\nhop ledger: prefix -> set of holder workers\nGET /metrics: orch_* counters and gauges",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el790326952",
   "originalText": "BACKGROUND  (gateway/monitoring/)\npoll every 5 s: /health, /v1/models, /metrics\nreadiness: warmup = 5 requests on the shared\n   prefix, then ready (weights loaded != ready)\nramp for a returning worker: 1 -> 2 -> 4 -> 8\nhop ledger: prefix -> set of holder workers\nGET /metrics: orch_* counters and gauges",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
