   "originalText": "Qwen3-8B BF16\nsame SGLang image +\nqwen25 tool parser\non ONE owned 24 GB\nGPU (demo: RTX 4090;\nprod: A10 24GB)\n\ninteractive only\n503 / 529 only\nNEVER 429\n\nfirst limiter: its KV\npool ~30k tokens\n-> cap 4 in flight\n\nDECIDED, NOT WIRED:\ncounted as\nleave_disabled",
