   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prometheus :29090\nscrapes gateway,\nworker A, worker B\n\nGrafana :23000\n- sheds by reason\n- placements per worker\n- queue depth per pod\n- engine running/queued\n- KV usage, TTFT p99\n- prefix hit rate\n- hops, evictions\n- stay or leave\n\n4 ALERTS\nKvCachePressure >0.85\nTtftSloBreach p99>1s\nHighShedRate >5 %\nWorkerDown up==0",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el703152336",
   "originalText": "Prometheus :29090\nscrapes gateway,\nworker A, worker B\n\nGrafana :23000\n- sheds by reason\n- placements per worker\n- queue depth per pod\n- engine running/queued\n- KV usage, TTFT p99\n- prefix hit rate\n- hops, evictions\n- stay or leave\n\n4 ALERTS\nKvCachePressure >0.85\nTtftSloBreach p99>1s\nHighShedRate >5 %\nWorkerDown up==0",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
